    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Crew Type (Bad Eden): Survivors / Militia.</em></p><p><strong>“We were here before your grand strategy, and we’ll be here after it catches fire.”</strong></p><p>Survivors and militias are what happens when ordinary people become infrastructure. They patch walls, ration supplies, drag neighbors out of burning buildings, and keep the faction alive long after cleaner doctrines would have folded.</p><ul><li><strong>Tactical Identity:</strong> You gain a skill rank in Athletics and Faith.</li><li><strong>Strategic Identity:</strong> Your faction starts with +1 Non-Lethal OP and +1 Economy OP.</li></ul>",
